WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.448
The Eilenberg Ganea conjecture fails.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.827
Algebraic and geometric dimension always agree, except

3
00:00:05.827 --> 00:00:08.250
possibly at two. Here they differ.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.804
Computing its homotopy rules out any two-dimensional model, so geometry needs three.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.369
Claimed: algebra says two, geometry says three.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.232
Lean: main theorem.
